{
  "_comment": "SPDX ids count as free when ScanCode's license index (shipped with license-expression) puts them in a free category: Permissive, Copyleft, Copyleft Limited or Public Domain. extra_free_spdx adds free ids the index lacks; not_free_spdx removes ids it calls free that are not (FSF-nonfree, hardware- or use-restricted) and bare aliases (\"2.0\", \"gpl\"). Ids compare case-insensitively, without -only/-or-later/+. free_keywords / nonfree_keywords: lowercase substrings used for non-SPDX license strings. Non-free keywords win.",
